I'm assuming here that your character is about level 14 or so or at
least close to it. In that case these are the things that I'd wish
for, in order of priority :

	blessed platinum yendorian express card
	blessed rustproof +3 gray dragon scale mail
	blessed archon figurine (if you're desparate for a weapon)

